<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets HK Telecom warrants.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets HK Telecom warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Wednesday it had issued 600 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$18	    PREMIUM	 21.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.231	 GEARING	 7.23x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   11.JUN.98	PAYDATE	 07.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	LISTING DATE  08.JUL.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$16.7	  EXER LOT	4,000</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW	HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		   PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
